{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kingdom Dice </strong>is not just a game that lets you feel like a mighty lord craving an unprecedented empire, but also a game that will fully reveal your entrepreneurial potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy land, pay taxes, crush your friends with rent, and build an empire where victory comes not by sword, but by gold and diplomacy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927310/extras/0ead69d908e54ada5b05e8f6e86da7b1.poster.avif?t=1767474439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927310/extras/0ead69d908e54ada5b05e8f6e86da7b1.webm?t=1767474439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927310/extras/0ead69d908e54ada5b05e8f6e86da7b1.mp4?t=1767474439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BEST GAME FOR FAMILY FUN</strong> \ud83c\udff0 Easy to learn so anyone can join in the fun \u2014 but reaching greatness? That takes skill, strategy, and control. So\u2026 are you ready to win?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unleash the full fun \u2014 grab your friends and dive into a world of adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to negotiate and collaborate to succeed\u2026 or pretend to be an ally only to snatch all the gold for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What strategy will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927310/extras/1469b7ae47b5b37ccd69459ae447ed12.poster.avif?t=1767474439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927310/extras/1469b7ae47b5b37ccd69459ae447ed12.webm?t=1767474439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927310/extras/1469b7ae47b5b37ccd69459ae447ed12.mp4?t=1767474439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 Build and upgrade your land</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Use dice, cards, and clever tactics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d Enjoy with friends (up to 4 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc Experience the thrill of deals and betrayal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Conquer lands for your empire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927310/extras/e7aa5d6eb4c60bf6b9dea8b732c33531.poster.avif?t=1767474439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927310/extras/e7aa5d6eb4c60bf6b9dea8b732c33531.webm?t=1767474439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927310/extras/e7aa5d6eb4c60bf6b9dea8b732c33531.mp4?t=1767474439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927310/extras/fd1651ca9b4ac287538e2d6cb87e7672.poster.avif?t=1767474439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927310/extras/fd1651ca9b4ac287538e2d6cb87e7672.webm?t=1767474439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><